            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonun içinde oluşturulan değişkenler, burada <code>bonus</code> gibi <strong>yerel kapsama</strong> sahiptir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;bonus&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>bonus</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyonun içinde oluşturulan değişkenler <strong>yerel kapsama</strong> sahiptir. Kodun <code>2000</code> yazdırması için yerel <code>bonus</code> değerini <code>100</code> yap.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>bonus</code>, ardından <code>100</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
