          {
            "title": "Local scope 2",
            "id": 86991,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yerel kapsamla, bir değişkene yalnızca onu oluşturan fonksiyonun içinde erişebilir veya onu güncelleyebiliriz. <code>bonus</code> değerini <code>200</code> olarak ayarlamayı dene.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>bonus</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>200</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yerel bir değişkene yalnızca onu oluşturan fonksiyonun içinde erişebilir veya onu güncelleyebilirsin.</p><p>Kodun <code>2100</code> yazdırması için <code>bonus</code> değerini güncelle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"add_bonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(salary)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bonus = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(salary + bonus)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"add_bonus(\" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2100\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>bonus</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>200</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
