          {
            "title": "Global scope 1",
            "id": 86994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir fonksiyon bloğunun dışında oluşturulan değişkenler, burada <code>shipping</code> gibi, <strong>global kapsama</strong> sahiptir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>shipping</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>10</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fonksiyon dışında oluşturulan bir değişken <strong>global kapsama</strong> sahiptir; bu yüzden fonksiyon onu okuyabilir. <code>64</code> yazdırmak için <code>shipping</code> değerini <code>10</code> olarak oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"cart\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>shipping</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>10</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Global access",
            "id": 86995,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Global kapsam sayesinde, <code>shipping</code> ile yaptığımız gibi değişkene kodun herhangi bir yerinden güvenle <strong>erişebiliriz</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"shipping = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(cart)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(cart + shipping)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_total(\" /><text value=\"54\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"64\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"64\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>shipping</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Global scope 2",
            "id": 86996,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buradaki player_1 gibi, fonksiyonların içinde oluşturulanlar dışındaki tüm değişkenler global kapsama sahiptir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>player_1</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Mario\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>if</code> bloğu fonksiyon değildir; bu nedenle buradaki <code>player_1</code> global kapsamını korur. <code>Player 1: Mario</code> yazdırmak için değerini <code>\"Mario\"</code> yap.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"single_player = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" single_player:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" player_1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mario&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Player 1: \" /><text value=\"{player_1}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"single_player\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Luigi&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Player 1: Mario\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>player_1</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"Mario\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
